sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Customer
    participant UI as Browser UI
    participant API as Python API
    participant DB as SQLite Database
    C->>UI: Choose movie and showtime
    UI->>API: GET /showtimes/{id}/seats
    API->>DB: Read occupied seats
    DB-->>API: Occupied seat IDs
    API-->>UI: Seat map and showtime price
    C->>UI: Select seats, snacks, promo
    C->>UI: Confirm demo booking
    UI->>API: POST /bookings (authenticated)
    API->>DB: BEGIN IMMEDIATE
    API->>DB: Read showtime and prices
    API->>DB: Check seat conflicts
    alt All seats available
        API->>DB: Insert booking and seat rows
        API->>DB: COMMIT
        API-->>UI: 201 booking code and total
        UI-->>C: Show booking in My Bookings
    else Seat already occupied
        API->>DB: ROLLBACK
        API-->>UI: 409 seat conflict
        UI-->>C: Select other seats
    end
